      '\nosubgrouping command.' + #10 +
      'The default value is: YES.'),
    (Name: 'NUM_PROC_THREADS';
     Kind: okInt; OrgKind: okBool; Group: 0;
     Format: ''; Depends: '';
     Default: '1'; MinVal: 0; MaxVal: 512;
     Values: '';
     Doc: 'The NUM_PROC_THREADS specifies the number of threads Doxygen is allowed to use' + #10 +
      'during processing. When set to 0 Doxygen will based this on the number of' + #10 +
      'cores available in the system. You can set it explicitly to a value larger' + #10 +
      'than 0 to get more control over the balance between CPU load and processing' + #10 +
      'speed. At this moment only the input processing can be done using multiple' + #10 +
      'threads. Since this is still an experimental feature the default is set to 1,' + #10 +
