      'The default value is: NO.'),
    (Name: 'EXTRACT_STATIC';
     Kind: okBool; OrgKind: okBool; Group: 1;
     Format: ''; Depends: '';
     Default: '0'; MinVal: 0; MaxVal: 0;
     Values: '';
     Doc: 'If the EXTRACT_STATIC tag is set to YES, the routines, variables, constants' + #10 +
