      'layout of pages" for information.' + #10 +
      '' + #10 +
      'Note that if you run Doxygen from a directory containing a file called' + #10 +
      'DoxygenLayout.xml, Doxygen will parse it automatically even if the LAYOUT_FILE' + #10 +
      'tag is left empty.'),
    (Name: 'CITE_BIB_FILES';
     Kind: okList; OrgKind: okBool; Group: 1;
     Format: 'file'; Depends: '';
     Default: ''; MinVal: 0; MaxVal: 0;
     Values: '';
