      'LATEX_BIB_STYLE. To use this feature you need bibtex and perl available in the' + #10 +
      'search path. See also \cite for info how to create references.'),
    (Name: 'EXTERNAL_TOOL_PATH';
     Kind: okList; OrgKind: okBool; Group: 1;
     Format: 'dir'; Depends: '';
     Default: ''; MinVal: 0; MaxVal: 0;
     Values: '';
     Doc: 'The EXTERNAL_TOOL_PATH tag can be used to extend the search path (PATH' + #10 +
      'environment variable) so that external tools such as latex and gs can be' + #10 +
      'found.' + #10 +
      'Note: Directories specified with EXTERNAL_TOOL_PATH are added in front of the' + #10 +
